\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. What is our calling's glorious hope
\par But inward holiness?
\par For this to Jesus I look up,
\par I calmly wait for this.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I wait, till He shall touch me clean,
\par Shall life and power impart,
\par Give me the faith that cast out sin
\par And purifies the heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. This is the dear redeeming grace,
\par For every sinner free;
\par Surely it shall on me take place,
\par The chief of sinners, me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. From all iniquity, from all,
\par He shall my soul redeem;
\par In Jesus I believe and shall
\par Believe myself to Him.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. When Jesus makes my heart His home,
\par My sin shall all depart;
\par And lo, He saith: I quickly come,
\par To fill and rule thy heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Be it according to thy word!
\par Redeem me from all my sin;
\par My heart would now receive Thee, Lord,
\par Come in, my Lord, come in!
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

